## What is broken

`scripts/lane-runner-v3.sh` dispatches by invoking **bare `codex`**, resolved from the
PATH of whatever shell launched the runner. The runner process was **restarted at
2026-08-11 05:08:20** (`ps -o lstart -p 57599`) from a shell that does **not** carry nvm
on its PATH, so bare `codex` now resolves to:

    /opt/homebrew/bin/codex   ->   codex-cli 0.133.0

which is below the **0.144.1** floor that knows `gpt-5.6` model ids. Every dispatch
therefore dies in ~14 seconds with:

    ERROR: {"type":"error","status":400,"error":{"type":"invalid_request_error",
     "message":"The 'gpt-5.6-sol' model requires a newer version of Codex. ..."}}

